        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, 2020, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, 2020, at plant
Technology shares determined based on data from ENTSO Transparency Platform. Only domestic electricity production is considered, electricity imports are neglected.; UUID:b3264fd1-1e55-348c-b5ca-b72613b9c3d1
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in France in 2018.
Location: France
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b3264fd1-1e55-348c-b5ca-b72613b9c3d1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
